    "- `media/2026-11-12/17e_shotgun_cables_receiver.png`, `17f_shotgun_cables_receiver_unlit.png`, `17g_shotgun_cables_front_unlit.png`, `17h_shotgun_cables_player_eye.png`, `17i_shotgun_cables_found.png` (twenty-sixth block; Blender Cycles renders of the re-exported GLB, not the game): the cable bundle on the receiver lit and unlit (texels as they are), the front bundle unlit with its imprint on the body, the receiver bundle from the player's eye, and the four cable groups painted red on a grey gun.\n");
  s = rep('## Twenty-sixth block: the shotgun\'s source arrives, and what it is', '## Twenty-sixth block: the shotgun\'s source arrives, what it is, and its cables');
  return s;
});
